{"metadata":{"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"title":[{"Plain":"“Boole 意象”"},2],"slug":[{"Plain":"Boole意象"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>若"},{"Local":{"url":"意象","text":"意象"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathcal E$ 中的内蕴 "},{"Local":{"url":"Heyting代数","text":"Heyting 代数"}},{"Plain":" $\\Omega$ (即"},{"Local":{"url":"子对象分类子","text":"子对象分类子"}},{"Plain":") 实为内蕴 Bool 代数, 则称其为 Bool 意象.</p>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>. 对于意象 $\\mathcal E$, 下列条件等价.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>$\\mathcal E$ 为 Bool 意象;</li>\n<li>"},{"Local":{"url":"否定","text":"否定"}},{"Plain":"算子 $\\neg\\colon \\Omega\\to\\Omega$ 满足 $\\neg\\neg = \\operatorname{id}$;</li>\n<li>对任意对象 $E\\in\\mathcal E$, "},{"Local":{"url":"Heyting代数","text":"Heyting 代数"}},{"Plain":" $\\operatorname{Sub}(E)$ 实为 "},{"Local":{"url":"Boole代数","text":"Boole 代数"}},{"Plain":";</li>\n<li>对任意子对象 $S\\rightarrowtail E$, 有 $\\neg S \\vee S = E$;</li>\n<li>态射 $\\text{true}\\colon 1\\to\\Omega$ 和 $\\text{false}=\\neg\\circ \\text{true}$ 给出同构 $1+1\\simeq \\Omega$.</li>\n</ul>\n"}]}}